  "description": "OFEJIV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H66 N8 O11 S8 Yb4,C4 H10 O2. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 5 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.576-3.643 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.91-111.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H76N8O13S8Yb4.",
